      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.42,
      "end_seconds": 38.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "is it worse at certain times?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.27,
      "end_seconds": 44.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "yes uh talking and lying down that makes it worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.86,
      "end_seconds": 48.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.35,
      "end_seconds": 63.69,
      "duration_seconds": 10.34,
      "text": "a eight out of ten, I suppose i've had a tickle at the back of my throat too, for nearly five years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.0,
      "end_seconds": 69.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "okay is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.91,
      "end_seconds": 73.5,
